      "rationale": "The pressure drop (condition) occurred while the work package was still in a 'preparation' state with no formal boundary release and blank execution record. The causal link is that the system remained un-isolated because procedural controls were not completed, allowing an external disturbance to manifest as a loss of service at the receiving point.",
