      "competingExplanation": "The interruption could be due to upstream distribution failure unrelated to maintenance activities; however, the timing coincides with preparation for work where boundaries were not yet secured.","evidenceGap":"Need evidence of whether any service-routing change occurred or if a temporary instruction attachment existed that might explain why no barrier was in place despite pressure drop. Also need confirmation on whether AL-44 maps to P-R at all times or only under specific conditions (per n-1bta5hn)."}
